<title>USA: TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $1.25 million Evert Cup women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>9-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 2-Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Venus Williams (U.S.) 6-4 5-7</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>6-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat 13-Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
